{"id":"621267","name":"韭菜粉条馅饼","author":"雨中漫步li","authorId":"10274398","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/621267/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"韭菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"粉条","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"300克"}],"sub":[{"name":"开水","amount":"70克"},{"name":"冷水","amount":"80克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉用一半倒入开水搅拌均匀，放凉用冷水合成一个面团，醒20分钟。","img":"images/621267/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"粉条放锅里煮30分钟，变软。","img":"images/621267/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"粉条切好，放老抽、蚝油、盐拌匀腌10分钟。","img":"images/621267/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"韭菜洗净。","img":"images/621267/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切好。","img":"images/621267/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"所有食材放在一起，放姜末。","img":"images/621267/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/621267/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"面团分成均匀的剂子。","img":"images/621267/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"擀成薄薄的面饼。","img":"images/621267/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入馅料，铺平。","img":"images/621267/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"上面盖上一个面饼，用叉子把边按压一下。","img":"images/621267/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"平底锅放一点油。","img":"images/621267/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入馅饼，小火慢慢烙3分钟。","img":"images/621267/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"中间反面，这样鼓起就熟了。","img":"images/621267/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"切小块。","img":"images/621267/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"香软好吃。","img":"images/621267/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}